ent-BluespaceArtilleryDesignator = BSA LCU
    .desc = A laser designator for NanoTrasen bluespace artillery. Three non-rechargeable charges. Wield (Z) to look far and designate targets at range. Fire modes via context menu. (use LMB to designate a target, after several seconds a marker will appear where the BSA will strike)

ent-AdminBluespaceArtilleryDesignator = ADMIN BSA LCU
    .desc = An admin bluespace artillery designator with nearly unlimited charges and instant targeting lock. (use LMB to designate a target, after several seconds a marker will appear where the BSA will strike)
    .suffix = Admin

ent-EffectBluespaceArtilleryTarget = bluespace artillery target
    .desc = The strike will land here.
